WHY THIS LICENSE

This repository is not free to relicense. Most of it derives from Paul
Carter's PC Assembly Language example code, released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:

    https://github.com/pacman128/pcasm

That license carries a ShareAlike condition, so adapted material has to be
distributed under the same terms. Two files here are adaptations of Carter's
work, and the rest of the repository is distributed under the same license so
that the terms covering it are unambiguous.


